OL,11,     Fof the cop who's pursuing him.
OL,12,G1425 The Shepherd of the Hills
OL,13,     F(1941) John Wayne stars as a moody
OL,14,     Fyoung man living in the Ozarks who
OL,15,     Fhas sworn revenge on his
OL,16,     Flong-absent father for deserting
OL,17,     Fhis mother. Then a kindly stranger
OL,18,     Fappears on the scene...
